        "english_name": "German",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "WWE SummerSlam 2026 (Tag 2) fand am Sonntag, dem 2. August 2026, im U.S. Bank Stadium in Minneapolis, Minnesota, statt. Match Card: Undisputed WWE Titel #1 Contendership Fatal Four Way Match: Kevin Owens vs. Sami Zayn vs. Finn Balor vs. Gunther WWE United States Titel Match: Trick Williams (c) vs. Baron Corbin Interim WWE Women's Titel Ladder Match (vakant): Charlotte Flair vs. Chelsea Green vs. Jade Cargill vs. Tiffany Stratton vs. Lash Legend Human Monies On A Pole Match: Danhausen vs. Dominik Mysterio WWE Intercontinental Titel Match: Penta (c) vs. Chad Gable WWE World Heavyweight Titel Match: Roman Reigns (c) vs. Seth Rollins",
          "runtime": 176,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "WWE SummerSlam 2026: Sonntag"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "PT",
